  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information has been Redacted in accordance with the two principled exceptions of the Foreign Aid Transparency and Accountability Act (FATAA) of 2016; including the health and security of implementing partners, as well as national interest of the United States.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity relates to Ukraine and strives to reduce the threat or impact of violent conflict and promote the peaceful resolution of differences, mitigate violence if it has already broken out, establish a framework for peace and reconciliation, and provide for the transition from conflict to post-conflict environments.</narrative>
  </description>
